# Local authoring tools, built into tools/ by scripts/build_flounder.py.
# They are how Ben writes data/art-tags.json and data/rsi-notes.json, so they
# never go on the public site.
tools/flounder-tagger.html
tools/flounder-notes.html

# The art tagger's local scratch. art-cache/ is the downloaded card art
# (gigabytes). set-outputs/ and the run log are raw tagger output already
# merged into data/art-tags.json. Backups are written before every cleanup.
art-cache/
tools/art-tools/set-outputs/
tools/art-tools/overnight-run.log
tools/art-tools/backups/
*.leakfix-backup-*

# Build fingerprints: a record of what this machine built. docs/BUILD-REPORT.md
# is the committed, human-readable version.
.build-history/

# Per-developer notes
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md

# Junk
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
_shot_*.png
.vercel
.env*
